 # Kpa: Expressed in a quasi-logarithmic scale of thirds,            |
 #      it ranges from Oo to 9                                       | 
 # Aa: Daily Mean of aa, unit 1 nT                                   |
 # CK24: quietest days over 24-hours with mean(aa) = Aa < 13 nT      |
